### Lab 6 — method security annotations (@PreAuthorize, @Secured, @RolesAllowed)
### Run the login requests first.

### Login as USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "user", "password": "user123" }

> {% client.global.set("userToken", response.body); %}

### Login as ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body); %}

### Login as SUPERADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "superadmin", "password": "superadmin123" }

> {% client.global.set("superadminToken", response.body); %}

### 1. USER -> profile, @PreAuthorize("isAuthenticated()") (expected 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/annotated/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 2. USER -> @PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('USER','ADMIN','SUPERADMIN')") (expected 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/annotated/user
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 3. USER -> @Secured({"ROLE_ADMIN","ROLE_SUPERADMIN"}) (expected 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/annotated/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 4. ADMIN -> @Secured({"ROLE_ADMIN","ROLE_SUPERADMIN"}) (expected 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/annotated/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. ADMIN -> @RolesAllowed("SUPERADMIN") (expected 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/annotated/superadmin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. SUPERADMIN -> @RolesAllowed("SUPERADMIN") (expected 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/annotated/superadmin
Authorization: Bearer {{superadminToken}}

### 7. USER -> own details, #username == authentication.name (expected 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/annotated/users/user
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 8. USER -> someone else's details (expected 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/annotated/users/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 9. ADMIN -> someone else's details (expected 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/annotated/users/user
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Anonymous -> profile (expected 401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/annotated/profile
